# Nextflow run artifacts and auto-installed/registry-fetched modules
**/work/
**/.nextflow*
**/modules/
*.log
run.log

# No rule for data fixtures: they live once in examples/data/, which ignores its own
# contents, and the examples that need them carry a `data` symlink into it. 19_shell-tools
# is the one example with a real data/ directory, and its FASTA is committed on purpose.
